[_tb_system_call storage=system/_POTTY.ks]

*Potty_01

[cm  ]
[tb_ptext_hide  time="0"  ]
[tb_image_hide  time="0"  ]
[tb_hide_message_window  ]
[bg  time="500"  method="crossfade"  storage="POTTY/Potty_01_01.jpg"  ]
[tb_show_message_window  ]
[tb_start_tyrano_code]
[if exp="f.Lingua==0"]
[_tb_end_tyrano_code]

[tb_start_text mode=1 ]
#ZACK
Oh cazzo...[p]
Mi saprebbe piaciuto molto coronare la mia carriera da scienziato...[p]
Ma il grande beneficio di questo lavoro di merda...[p]
E' quello di venire qua in piscina e farsi prendere un attacco di cuore guardando questi culi freschi e sodi!!![p]
#ILARY
Allora sei pronta, Potty?[p]
[_tb_end_text]

[tb_start_tyrano_code]
[endif]
[_tb_end_tyrano_code]

[tb_start_tyrano_code]
[if exp="f.Lingua>0 && f.Lingua!=3"]
[_tb_end_tyrano_code]

[tb_start_text mode=1 ]
#ZACK
Oh fuck...[p]
I would have loved to crown my career as a scientist....[p]
But the great benefit of this shitty job....[p]
Is to come here to the pool and get a heart attack looking at these fresh, firm asses!!![p]
#ILARY
So are you ready, Potty?[p]
[_tb_end_text]

[tb_start_tyrano_code]
[endif]
[tb_start_tyrano_code]
[if exp="f.Lingua==3"]
[_tb_end_tyrano_code]
[tb_start_text mode=1 ]
#ZACK
Ох, чёрт...[p]
Я ведь мечтал увенчать свою карьеру учёного...[p]
Но главное преимущество этой паршивой работы...[p]
В том, что можно прийти к бассейну и получить сердечный приступ, глядя на эти упругие попки!!![p]
#ILARY
Ну что, Потти, готова?[p]
[_tb_end_text]
[tb_start_tyrano_code]
[endif]
[_tb_end_tyrano_code]
[_tb_end_tyrano_code]

[tb_hide_message_window  ]
[bg  time="500"  method="crossfade"  storage="POTTY/Potty_01_02.jpg"  ]
[tb_show_message_window  ]
[tb_start_tyrano_code]
[if exp="f.Lingua==0"]
[_tb_end_tyrano_code]

[tb_start_text mode=1 ]
#POTTY
Io sono sempre pronta![p]
Ma possibile che tu non capisca?[p]
Sei un'ottima ginnasta, ma come pensi di potermi battere nel nuoto?[p]
Io mi alleno tutti i giorni, mattina e pomeriggio, fin da quando ero un bambina!!![p]
[_tb_end_text]

[tb_start_tyrano_code]
[endif]
[_tb_end_tyrano_code]

[tb_start_tyrano_code]
[if exp="f.Lingua>0 && f.Lingua!=3"]
[_tb_end_tyrano_code]

[tb_start_text mode=1 ]
#POTTY
I am always ready![p]
But is it possible that you don't understand?[p]
You are an excellent gymnast, but how do you think you can beat me in swimming?[p]
I have been training every day, morning and afternoon, since I was a little girl!!![p]
[_tb_end_text]

[tb_start_tyrano_code]
[endif]
[tb_start_tyrano_code]
[if exp="f.Lingua==3"]
[_tb_end_tyrano_code]
[tb_start_text mode=1 ]
#POTTY
Я всегда готова![p]
Неужели ты до сих пор не поняла?[p]
Ты отличная гимнастка, но как собираешься победить меня в плавании?[p]
Я тренируюсь каждый день, утром и вечером, с самого детства!!![p]
[_tb_end_text]
[tb_start_tyrano_code]
[endif]
[_tb_end_tyrano_code]
[_tb_end_tyrano_code]

[tb_hide_message_window  ]
[bg  time="500"  method="crossfade"  storage="POTTY/Potty_01_03.jpg"  ]
[tb_show_message_window  ]
[tb_start_tyrano_code]
[if exp="f.Lingua==0"]
[_tb_end_tyrano_code]

[tb_start_text mode=1 ]
#ILARY
Sono sicura che stavolta riuscirò a batterti!!![p]
Ho migliorato la mia tecnica di nuoto...[p]
E sono sicura di poterti battere se uso lo stile...[p]
[_tb_end_text]

[tb_start_tyrano_code]
[endif]
[_tb_end_tyrano_code]

[tb_start_tyrano_code]
[if exp="f.Lingua>0 && f.Lingua!=3"]
[_tb_end_tyrano_code]

[tb_start_text mode=1 ]
#ILARY
I am sure I can beat you this time!!![p]
I have improved my swimming technique....[p]
And I'm sure I can beat you if I use the style....[p]
[_tb_end_text]

[tb_start_tyrano_code]
[endif]
[tb_start_tyrano_code]
[if exp="f.Lingua==3"]
[_tb_end_tyrano_code]
[tb_start_text mode=1 ]
#ILARY
Уверена, на этот раз я тебя обгоню!!![p]
Я улучшила свою технику плавания...[p]
И уверена, что смогу победить, если воспользуюсь стилем...[p]
[_tb_end_text]
[tb_start_tyrano_code]
[endif]
[_tb_end_tyrano_code]
[_tb_end_tyrano_code]

