All right...[p]
Let's do it...[p]
But I warned you![p]
Then don't come crying to me!!![p]
[_tb_end_text]

[tb_start_tyrano_code]
[endif]
[tb_start_tyrano_code]
[if exp="f.Lingua==3"]
