But I can't skip my workouts....[p]
I'm so close to being called up by the national team!!![p]
Do you understand? This is my dream...[p]
Wouldn't you do anything to pursue your dream?[p]
#ZACK
Shit... So you're going to train here in secret???[p]
Don't you understand how risky this is for me???[p]
[_tb_end_text]

