[tb_start_text mode=1 ]
#ZACK
Mi dispiace molto, Potty...[p]
Capisco benissimo quello che mi dici, e l'importanza di combattere per i proprio sogni...[p]
Ma sono davvero incasinato, e non posso correre questo rischio...[p]
Ti prego, non odiarmi![p]
#POTTY
Sob...[p]
[_tb_end_text]

[tb_start_tyrano_code]
[endif]
[_tb_end_tyrano_code]

[tb_start_tyrano_code]
[if exp="f.Lingua>0 && f.Lingua!=3"]
[_tb_end_tyrano_code]

[tb_start_text mode=1 ]
#ZACK
I'm so sorry, Potty...[p]
I totally understand what you're saying, and the importance of fighting for one's dreams....[p]
But I'm really messed up, and I can't take that risk....[p]
Please don't hate me![p]
#POTTY
Sob...[p]
[_tb_end_text]

[tb_start_tyrano_code]
[endif]
[tb_start_tyrano_code]
[if exp="f.Lingua==3"]
[_tb_end_tyrano_code]
[tb_start_text mode=1 ]
#ZACK
Прости, Потти...[p]
Я прекрасно понимаю, о чём ты говоришь, и как важно бороться за свою мечту...[p]
Но я не могу пойти на такой риск...[p]
Пожалуйста, не злись на меня![p]
#POTTY
Всхлип...[p]
[_tb_end_text]
[tb_start_tyrano_code]
[endif]
